  - `meanings.json` is generated from `web_export.MEANINGS`. It has exactly the four required keys, and `--check` covers it through `test_committed_export_is_current`.
  - `app.js` contains no meaning string. It selects by `meanings[data.sendhold_verdict.value]`.
  - An unmapped verdict renders `<p role="alert" data-error="missing-meaning">` naming the value, with no `console.error`. A missing early-stop key renders the same kind of alert.
